      "The overdue threshold is configurable with a default of 7. An invoice is overdue when today's local date in the configured business time zone (Europe/London in the examples) minus the due date is at least the threshold. 'Days overdue' means calendar days since the due date (ASM-2, ASM-3, ASM-10, ASM-11).",
